1
00:00:00,208 --> 00:00:02,078
(Bernadette:)I don't even
know where to begin.

2
00:00:02,077 --> 00:00:05,007
Well, in The Sound of Music,
Julie Andrews says,

3
00:00:05,013 --> 00:00:06,583
"Let's start at
the very beginning.

4
00:00:06,581 --> 00:00:08,881
A very good place to start."

5
00:00:08,884 --> 00:00:11,654
(Bernadette:)Oh, I was gonna start
at the end.

6
00:00:11,653 --> 00:00:13,153
(Bernadette:)Thank God you're here.

7
00:00:14,923 --> 00:00:18,723
(Raj:)Well, I think the first thing we
should get rid of is that tone.

8
00:00:18,727 --> 00:00:21,857
(Amy:)Sorry.

9
00:00:21,863 --> 00:00:23,193
(Bernadette:)I should probably keep this

10
00:00:23,198 --> 00:00:24,528
(Bernadette:)in case we have a girl.

11
00:00:24,533 --> 00:00:25,663
(Raj:)Oh, that's a nice one.

12
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:27,097
(Raj:)Was it yours when
you were little?

13
00:00:27,102 --> 00:00:28,502
(Bernadette:)My dad built it for me.

14
00:00:28,503 --> 00:00:30,003
(Raj:)Wow, it's so cute.

15
00:00:30,005 --> 00:00:33,005
(Bernadette:)This was the husband
and this was the wife.

16
00:00:33,008 --> 00:00:34,608
(Bernadette:)They'd go out on
adventures together.

17
00:00:34,609 --> 00:00:36,139
(Bernadette:)Cruises, skiing,

18
00:00:36,144 --> 00:00:37,374
(Bernadette:)horseback riding.

19
00:00:37,379 --> 00:00:41,079
(Bernadette:)That was really me just
duct taping them to our dog.

20
00:00:41,083 --> 00:00:42,653
(Raj:)Oh, and did they have kids?

21
00:00:42,651 --> 00:00:45,081
(Bernadette:)They did, but the mommy
and daddy didn't like them,

22
00:00:45,087 --> 00:00:46,487
(Bernadette:)so they shipped them off
to an orphanage

23
00:00:46,488 --> 00:00:48,888
(Bernadette:)I made out of a shoebox.

24
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:52,760
(Raj:)Yeah, that's not worrisome
at all.

25
00:00:52,761 --> 00:00:56,161
(Bernadette:)Not every girl dreams
about being a mom.

26
00:00:56,164 --> 00:00:59,024
(Bernadette:)Sometimes you think
you're never gonna have kids

